From 9785b7c709c610e46cff0928fa1c34cee7525c8a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cycles Houdini engine authoring <engine@localhost>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 04:31:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Reuse OpenSubdiv setup within a bounded IPR scene cache

Rationale: Rebuilding Catmull-Clark topology and patch tables on repeated adaptive dicing can cost over a hundred milliseconds on dense control meshes.
Contract: Reuse only exactly matching setup for opted-in adaptive meshes, evaluate live positions and primvars, and budget retained entries and active readers per scene.
Tests: tests/houdini_subdivision_topology_cache_smoke.py, tests/houdini_subdivision_smoke.py
